  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap out-of-bounds write via paste box coordinates\n     near the signed 32-bit integer limits (ELSCVE-233283)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-59199.patch: compute the paste box\n       dimensions as int64_t in ImagingPaste() and ImagingFill2() in\n       src/libImaging/Paste.c. Adds a regression test in\n       Tests/test_image_paste.py.\n     - CVE-2026-59199\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds read when memory-mapping McIdas AREA\n     images with an undersized row stride (ELSCVE-233312)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-54058.patch: raise the row stride to at\n       least one full row of pixels in PyImaging_MapBuffer() in src/map.c.\n       Adds a regression test in Tests/test_file_mcidas.py.\n     - CVE-2026-54058",
